<section id="kontakt" class="mb-16 scroll-mt-24">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 bg-red-100 text-red-700 text-sm font-bold rounded-lg">8</span>
      Kontakt w sprawach danych
    </h2>
  
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 to-gray-800 rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-10 text-white relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-red-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl -translate-y-1/2 translate-x-1/2"></div>
      
      <div class="relative grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-4">Administrator danych</h3>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-gray-300 text-sm">
            <p class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-red-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"/>
              </svg>
              <%= company.nameCompany %>
            </p>
            <p class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-red-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"/>
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/>
              </svg>
              <%= company.street %> <%= company.numberHome %>, <%= company.zipCode %> <%= company.city %>
            </p>
            <p class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-red-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/>
              </svg>
              <a href="mailto:sekretariat@ceea.org.pl" class="text-red-400 hover:text-red-300 transition-colors">sekretariat@ceea.org.pl</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
  
        <div>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-gray-300 text-sm">
            
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-4">
              Odpowiadamy na wnioski w ciągu <strong>30 dni</strong>. W skomplikowanych przypadkach 
              możemy przedłużyć ten termin o kolejne 60 dni, informując Cię o powodach opóźnienia.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
  
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>